    "buildDescription": "Passive aura build, all damage from Aura of Sol, kept Solar so every rune and armor piece pulls the same way: Rapid Attack Chance and Attack Speed for the hit rate (Ring of Ruin turns the rate into growth), Critical Hit Damage, Solar Damage, Damage to Burning and Damage to Healthy for the layers, Blood of Ulth Vuul with three Ancient Sunblessed copies, Oathbreaker's Boots for Passive Ability Damage, Ordwyrn Crown. Tank: Sunblessed resistances, Health, Health Regeneration, Damage Taken Staggered at its cap, block from the shield. Not AFK: it kills what stands next to it, so move away from ranged mobs.",
